3. GIAI THUAT AP DUNG

Su dung iperf: Bang thong (MBps), Thong luong (Mbps), So lan truyen lai ban tin TCP, Ti le mat mat goi tin UDP.

* Do bang thong,thong luong:
+ Server: iperf -s
+ Client: iperf -c [192.168.x.x] -t 20 -i 1 (Neu ap dung giai thuat thi them -w)

* do mat mat goi tin
+ Server: iperf -s
+ Client: iperf -c [192.168.x.x] -u -t 200 -i 20 (Neu ap dung giai thuat thi them -w)

* Do so lan truyen lai ban tin TCP: (Tim gia tri retr)
+ Server: iperf3 -s
+ Client: iperf3 -c [192.168.x.x] -t 20 -i 1 (-w neu ap dung giai thuat)

